{"diagnosis": "Fetch TB reports TRAP: no progress max_addr=0x00000000 with tohost FAIL 0xdead after CYCLES=2009, vs expected PC advancing through 256-word NOP mem. reg_pc never leaves PROGADDR_RESET so max_addr stays 0. Root cause at picorv32.v:1450 where do_waitirq <= 1 is forced every cycle, stalling decode/fetch and blocking any progress.", "patch_diff": "diff --git a/picorv32.v b/picorv32.v
--- a/picorv32.v
+++ b/picorv32.v
@@ -1448,3 +1448,3 @@
 		decoder_pseudo_trigger <= 0;
 		decoder_pseudo_trigger_q <= decoder_pseudo_trigger;
-		do_waitirq <= 1;
+		do_waitirq <= 0;
", "expected": "tohost PASS (not FAIL 0xdead), max_addr advances beyond 0x00000000 with no TRAP: no progress"}

